    "preamble": "Page No.# 1/3 vs The State Of Assam on 10 December, 2020 Author: Rumi Kumari Phukan Bench: Rumi Kumari Phukan Page No.# 1/3 Gahc010151252020 The Gauhati High Court (High Court Of Assam, Nagaland, Mizoram And Arunachal Pradesh) Case No. : Ab/3004/2020 Md. Mannas Ali And 4 Ors S/O Late Abdul Khaleque, R/O Vill-Barthal Kacharigaon, P.O.- Doloigaon, P.S.-Moirabari, Dist-Morigaon, Assam, Pin-782126 2: Mozibur Rahman S/O Late Mehar Ali R/O Vill-Barthal Kacharigaon P.O.-Doloigaon P.S.-Moirabari Dist-Morigaon Assam Pin-782126 3: Dildar Hussain S/O Md. Nur Mahammad R/O Vill-Barthal Kacharigaon P.O.-Doloigaon P.S.-Moirabari Dist-Morigaon Assam Pin-782126 4: Hakimul Islam S/O Late Jaban Ali R/O Vill-Barthal Kacharigaon P.O.-Doloigaon P.S.-Moirabari Dist-Morigaon Assam Pin-782126 5: Amradul Islam S/O Abdul Mozid Page No.# 1/3 vs The State Of Assam on 10 December, 2020 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/70933914/ 1 R/O Vill-Barthal Kacharigaon P.O.-Doloigaon P.S.-Moirabari Dist-Morigaon Assam Pin-78212 Versus The State Of Assam Represented By The Public Prosecutor, Assam Advocate for the Petitioner : Mr. N Zaman Advocate for the Respondent : Pp, Assam Before Hon'Ble Mrs. Justice Rumi Kumari Phukan Order",
    "facts": "By this pre-arrest bail application filed under Section 438 of the CrPC, the five petitioners, namely, 1.Md. Mannas Ali, 2. Mozibur Rahman, 3. Dildar Hussain, 4. Hakimul Islam and 5. Amradul Islam have sought for releasing them on bail in connection with the Moirabari P.S. Case No.423/2020, registered under Sections 269/272/426/420/34 of the IPC.",
